graph Guess the number
  node ●
  node choose a secret number
  node ◇
  node ask for a number
  node is it the secret?
  node you win
  node ◉
  node is it smaller?
  node say "higher"
  node say "lower"
  node tries left?
  node you lose
  node ◉
  ● -> choose a secret number
  choose a secret number -> ◇
  ◇ -> ask for a number
  ask for a number -> is it the secret?
  is it the secret? -> you win: yes
  you win -> ◉
  is it the secret? -> is it smaller?: no
  is it smaller? -> say "higher": yes
  is it smaller? -> say "lower": no
  say "lower" -> tries left?
  say "higher" -> tries left?
  tries left? -> ◇: yes
  tries left? -> you lose: no
  you lose -> ◉
